      "role": "user",
      "content": "small things don't matter though. a walk or a hobby isn't gonna change the fact that i'm literally selling my life away for a paycheck that barely covers rent. it's just a loop. no matter what i do, the machine keeps spinning and i'm just stuck in it until i die. it feels like there's no actual way out of this cycle, just more of the same until the battery runs out.",
